     "title_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:title": "What Macnica Delivers for Altera Designs",
      "type": "h2",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
     },
     "title_2": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:title": "From prototype to production, with the right hardware and toolchain",
      "type": "h3",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
     },
     "text_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<p>Macnica supports Altera programs across device selection, development software, evaluation kits, and design-in enablement. Whether you are building a SmartNIC, a vision pipeline, an industrial controller, or a secure edge gateway, we help you stand up a working platform quickly and reduce risk on the path to production.</p>",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     }
    },
    "container_2": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
     "cq:styleIds": [
      "",
      "1717498052331",
      "1717498055877"
     ],
     "title_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:title": "Macnica support highlights",
      "type": "h4",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
     },
     "text_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<ul>\n<li>Toolchain guidance across FPGA design, simulation, embedded, and high-speed I/O workflows</li>\n<li>Recommended development kits and accessories aligned to your I/O, memory, and performance targets</li>\n<li>Architecture support for storage, networking, and security stacks built on Altera platforms</li>\n<li>Supply and fulfillment planning from evaluation units to pilot builds and production ramps</li>\n</ul>",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     }
    },
    "container_3": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
     "cq:styleIds": [
      "",
      "1717498052331",
      "1717498055877"
     ],
     "title_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:title": "Edge AI Sensor Bridging, Powered by Altera",
      "type": "h3",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
     },
     "text_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<p>Altera FPGAs connect high speed sensors to NVIDIA GPU compute for real time edge AI. See our Holoscan Sensor Bridge reference designs and available dev kits. <b><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/altera/altera-holoscan.html\" target=\"_self\">Learn more</a></b></p>",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
     }
    }
   },
