     "tabs_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/tabs",
      "item_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "FPGAs, SoCs, CPLDs",
       "cq:panelTitle": "FPGAs, SoCs, CPLDs",
       "layout": "responsiveGrid",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
       "cq:styleIds": [
        "",
        "1717498056876",
        "1717498055877"
       ],
       "container_1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
        "cq:styleIds": [
         "",
         "1717498052331",
         "1717498055877"
        ],
        "title_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "jcr:title": "Overview",
         "type": "h4",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
        },
        "text_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "text": "<p>Altera offers a broad portfolio of programmable logic solutions spanning high-performance data center acceleration, mid-range embedded platforms, and power and cost optimized control designs.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0\"><br>\nMacnica helps you select the right device family, map your I/O and memory requirements, and accelerate bring-up from evaluation through production.</p>",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
         "textIsRich": "true"
        }
       },
       "container_2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
        "cq:styleIds": [
         "",
         "1717498052331",
         "1717498055877"
        ],
        "title_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "jcr:title": "Portfolio At-a-Glance",
         "type": "h4",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
        },
        "flexcontainer_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/flexcontainer",
         "cq:styleIds": [
          "",
          "1719484596357"
         ],
         "flexcontaineritem_1": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/flexcontaineritem",
          "text_1": {
           "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
           "text": "<p><b>High-Performance</b></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0\">For maximum bandwidth, transceiver density, and compute scaling.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/altera/agilex/altera-agilex-9-fpga-and-soc-overview.html\" target=\"_self\">Agilex 9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/altera/agilex/altera-agilex-7-fpga-and-soc-overview.html\" target=\"_self\">Agilex 7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/altera/altera-stratix-10.html\" target=\"_self\">Stratix 10</a></li>\n</ul>",
           "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
           "textIsRich": "true"
          }
         },
         "flexcontaineritem_2": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/flexcontaineritem",
          "text_1": {
           "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
           "text": "<p><b>Mid-Range</b></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0\">For balanced performance, power, and cost across embedded and edge workloads.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/altera/agilex/altera-agilex-5-fpga-and-soc-overview.html\" target=\"_self\">Agilex 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/altera/altera-arria-10/altera-arria-10-gt-soc-fpga.html\" target=\"_self\">Arria 10 GT</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/altera/altera-arria-10/altera-arria-10-sx-soc-fpga.html\" target=\"_self\">Arria 10 SX</a></li>\n</ul>",
           "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
           "textIsRich": "true"
          }
         },
         "flexcontaineritem_3": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/flexcontaineritem",
          "text_1": {
           "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
           "text": "<p><b>Power and Cost-Optimized</b><br>\nFor control, interface bridging, and cost-sensitive embedded systems.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/altera/agilex/agilex-3-fpga-and-soc-overview.html\" target=\"_self\">Agilex 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/altera/altera-max-10.html\" target=\"_self\">MAX 10</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/altera/altera-cyclone-10-fpga.html\" target=\"_self\">Cyclone 10</a></li>\n</ul>",
           "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
           "textIsRich": "true"
          }
         }
        }
       },
       "container_3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
        "cq:styleIds": [
         "",
         "1717498052331",
         "1717498055877"
        ],
        "title_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "jcr:title": "Where these devices fit",
         "type": "h4",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
        },
        "text_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "text": "<ul>\n<li><b>Networking and infrastructure:</b> Ethernet, PCIe-based data movers, packet processing, timing, and gateways</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Industrial and robotics:</b>&nbsp;Deterministic control, sensor fusion, connectivity, safety and security design patterns</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>ProAV and broadcast:</b>&nbsp;Video transport, processing, and interface bridging</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Edge AI and vision:</b>&nbsp;Inference pipelines, sensor ingest, compression, and storage</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Secure embedded:</b>&nbsp;Root-of-trust patterns, authenticated updates, and encrypted data paths</li>\n</ul>",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
         "textIsRich": "true"
        }
       },
       "container_4": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
        "cq:styleIds": [
         "",
         "1717498052331",
         "1717498055877"
        ],
        "title_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "jcr:title": "Why Macnica?",
         "type": "h4",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
        },
        "text_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "text": "<ul>\n<li>Device selection guidance aligned to bandwidth, interfaces, lifecycle, and BOM targets</li>\n<li>Architecture support across compute, networking, storage, and security stacks</li>\n<li>Fulfillment support for evaluation, pilot builds, and production ramps</li>\n</ul>",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
         "textIsRich": "true"
        }
       }
      },
      "item_2": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Development SW and Tools",
       "cq:panelTitle": "Development SW and Tools",
       "layout": "responsiveGrid",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
       "cq:styleIds": [
        "",
        "1717498056876",
        "1717498055877"
       ],
       "container_1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
        "cq:styleIds": [
         "",
         "1717498052331",
         "1717498055877"
        ],
        "title_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "jcr:title": "Overview",
         "type": "h4",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
        },
        "text_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "text": "<p>Altera provides a complete suite of development tools for every stage of an FPGA, SoC, or CPLD design. This includes core FPGA design software, simulation, embedded development tools, utilities for power and high-speed links, plus higher-level flows for acceleration and AI.</p>",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
         "textIsRich": "true"
        }
       },
       "container_2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
        "cq:styleIds": [
         "",
         "1717498052331",
         "1717498055877"
        ],
        "title_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "jcr:title": "1. Core FPGA design environment",
         "type": "h4",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
        },
        "text_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "text": "<p><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/altera/altera-quartus-prime.html\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b>Quartus Prime Design Software</b></a> is the primary environment for designing FPGAs, SoC FPGAs, and CPLDs, including IP integration, compile, timing closure, and programming.<br>\n<br>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0\">Platform Designer inside Quartus Prime is used for system integration, automatically generating interconnect logic to connect IP functions and subsystems.</p>\n<p><b>Best for:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>RTL and IP-based design flows</li>\n<li>System integration using Platform Designer</li>\n<li>Build, timing analysis, and device programming</li>\n</ul>",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
         "textIsRich": "true"
        }
       },
       "container_3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
        "cq:styleIds": [
         "",
         "1717498052331",
         "1717498055877"
        ],
        "title_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "jcr:title": "2. Simulation and verification",
         "type": "h4",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
        },
        "text_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "text": "<p>Questa Altera FPGA Edition supports behavioral simulation, HDL testbenches, Tcl scripting, and works with Quartus Prime editions.</p>\n<p><b>Best for:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pre-hardware verification and regression</li>\n<li>Faster debug of complex designs before board bring-up</li>\n</ul>",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
         "textIsRich": "true"
        }
       },
       "container_4": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
        "cq:styleIds": [
         "",
         "1717498052331",
         "1717498055877"
        ],
        "title_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "jcr:title": "3. Utilities for power, thermal, and high-speed links",
         "type": "h4",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
        },
        "text_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "text": "<p>Altera’s development tool ecosystem includes utilities such as <b>Power and Thermal Analyzer</b>, <b>Advanced Link Analyzer</b>, and <b>Transceiver Toolkit</b>.</p>\n<p><b>Best for:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Early power budgeting, thermal planning</li>\n<li>SERDES and link analysis workflows during bring-up and validation</li>\n</ul>",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
         "textIsRich": "true"
        }
       },
       "container_5": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
        "cq:styleIds": [
         "",
         "1717498052331",
         "1717498055877"
        ],
        "title_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "jcr:title": "4. Embedded development tools and software",
         "type": "h4",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
        },
        "text_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "text": "<p>For embedded and SoC workflows, Altera lists tools such as Nios V, Ashling RISCFree IDE, and Visual Designer Studio.</p>\n<p><b>Best for:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Embedded control planes and management functions using Nios V</li>\n<li>Debug workflows and embedded bring-up aligned to Altera platforms</li>\n</ul>",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
         "textIsRich": "true"
        }
       },
       "container_6": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
        "cq:styleIds": [
         "",
         "1717498052331",
         "1717498055877"
        ],
        "title_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "jcr:title": "5. Higher-level development options",
         "type": "h4",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
        },
        "text_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "text": "<p>Depending on your application, Altera provides additional development tools including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Open FPGA Stack (OFS)</b> for platform-level acceleration stacks</li>\n<li><b>P4 Suite for FPGAs</b> for programmable packet processing workflows</li>\n<li><b>FPGA AI Suite</b> for AI development workflows on FPGA platforms</li>\n</ul>",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
         "textIsRich": "true"
        }
       },
       "container_7": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
        "cq:styleIds": [
         "",
         "1717498052331",
         "1717498055877"
        ],
        "title_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "jcr:title": "Why Macnica?",
         "type": "h4",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
        },
        "text_1": {
         "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
         "text": "<ul>\n<li>Toolchain mapping across hardware, simulation, embedded, and high-speed I/O workflows</li>\n<li>Guidance selecting Quartus edition and planning installs, device support, and licenses</li>\n<li>Bring-up support for transceivers and link analysis workflows using Altera utilities</li>\n<li>Platform guidance when moving from dev kits to a production hardware design</li>\n</ul>",
         "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
         "textIsRich": "true"
        }
       }
      },
      "item_3": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Development Kits",
       "cq:panelTitle": "Development Kits",
       "layout": "responsiveGrid",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
       "cq:styleIds": [
        "",
